  "description": "MedEmbed Small Biomedical Matryoshka v2 is a public Apache-2.0 sentence-transformers model for biomedical semantic similarity and retrieval. Hugging Face metadata rechecked on 2026-05-28T22Z reports private=false, gated=false, disabled=false, library_name=sentence-transformers, pipeline_tag=sentence-similarity, revision 0e64af8703721ac187772ae93658360a80d72496, and safetensors total 33,360,000 F32 parameters. The model card describes a 384-dimensional dense vector space, 512-token maximum sequence length, cosine similarity, CLS pooling, and Matryoshka training for lower-dimensional retrieval tradeoffs. The established hidden TEI CUDA 1.9.3 row supports L40S, B200, and H200 but failed before readiness on B300/SM103 with `cuda compute cap 103 is not supported`. This separate hidden row reuses the already mirrored official vLLM 0.21.0 CUDA 13 image, launches it with `--runner pooling`, and selects CLS pooling with pooler activation so vLLM applies the normalization required by the sentence-transformers Normalize module. The 2026-05-28T22Z hidden B300/uk-south1 probe passed with 72.295 s startup, 70 ms p50 client-wall request time, 742.86 tokens/s, and 0.98 GB VRAM across 3 warmups and 10 measured embedding requests. Keep hidden/onboarding/default-ineligible until embedding parity against the TEI row and local sentence-transformers output, broader matrix expansion, and healthcare product safety review are complete.",
